---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="合作與分潤說明｜PickleStart Taiwan"
  description="了解 PickleStart Taiwan 的合作連結、分潤方式，以及商品價格、優惠與供貨資訊的來源。"
>
  <article class="affiliate-page">
    <header class="affiliate-hero">
      <div class="affiliate-hero-copy">
        <p class="affiliate-eyebrow">AFFILIATE DISCLOSURE</p>

        <h1>合作與分潤說明</h1>

        <p class="affiliate-lead">
          PickleStart 的部分商品連結未來可能包含品牌合作、聯盟行銷或其他分潤連結。
          當你透過這些連結完成符合條件的購買時，PickleStart 可能獲得合作收益。
        </p>
      </div>

      <aside class="affiliate-summary-card">
        <p class="summary-kicker">DISCLOSURE</p>

        <div class="summary-item">
          <span>01</span>
          <div>
            <strong>合作連結會適當標示</strong>
            <p>若連結屬於合作、分潤或專屬優惠，我們會在適當位置說明。</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="summary-item">
          <span>02</span>
          <div>
            <strong>購買資訊以商家頁面為準</strong>
            <p>價格、庫存、優惠、配送與退換貨條件，都可能隨時間變動。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </header>

    <section class="affiliate-section">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="affiliate-kicker">WHAT THIS MEANS</p>
        <h2>這代表什麼？</h2>
        <p>
          對使用者來說，最重要的是知道某些商品連結可能帶有商業合作關係，
          以及實際交易條件仍由外部商家決定。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="affiliate-fact-grid">
        <article>
          <span>01</span>
          <strong>合作連結</strong>
          <p>部分商品按鈕未來可能連往合作品牌、合作通路或聯盟行銷頁面。</p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <span>02</span>
          <strong>可能產生收益</strong>
          <p>若你完成符合條件的購買，PickleStart 可能獲得分潤或其他合作收益。</p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <span>03</span>
          <strong>價格與供貨</strong>
          <p>實際價格、庫存、折扣、運費與購買條件，以商家頁面當下資訊為準。</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="affiliate-section current-links-section">
      <div>
        <p class="affiliate-kicker">CURRENT LINKS</p>
        <h2>目前商品連結以公開來源頁面為主</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="current-links-copy">
        <p>
          目前 PickleStart 大部分商品按鈕會連往品牌官方或商店的公開商品頁面，
          方便你查看最新規格、價格與供貨資訊。
        </p>

        <p>
          未來若加入合作、分潤或專屬優惠連結，我們會保留這份說明，
          並在適當位置標示相關合作資訊。
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="affiliate-section merchant-section">
      <div class="merchant-card">
        <p class="affiliate-kicker">MERCHANT INFORMATION</p>
        <h2>購買前，請再確認商家頁面的最新資訊</h2>

        <p>
          PickleStart 不負責外部商家的定價、庫存、配送、付款方式或退換貨政策。
          商品資訊可能在我們更新頁面後發生變動，因此購買前仍建議回到原始商品頁再次確認。
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="affiliate-footer-links">
      <div>
        <p class="affiliate-kicker">LEARN MORE</p>
        <h2>想了解 PickleStart 怎麼整理推薦？</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="affiliate-link-group">
        <a href="/how-we-recommend/">查看推薦方式 →</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>

  <style>
    .affiliate-page {
      --affiliate-navy: #10243f;
      --affiliate-blue: #087fa5;
      --affiliate-lime: #e2f52c;
      --affiliate-text: #536579;
      --affiliate-muted: #748493;
      --affiliate-line: #dfe7ea;
      --affiliate-surface: #f7faf9;

      width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 40px));
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 52px 0 88px;
      color: var(--affiliate-text);
    }

    .affiliate-hero {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.35fr) minmax(320px, 0.65fr);
      gap: 56px;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 470px;
      padding: 42px 0 66px;
    }

    .affiliate-hero-copy {
      max-width: 700px;
    }

    .affiliate-eyebrow,
    .affiliate-kicker,
    .summary-kicker {
      margin: 0 0 14px;
      color: var(--affiliate-blue);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 850;
      letter-spacing: 0.13em;
    }

    .affiliate-hero h1 {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--affiliate-navy);
      font-size: clamp(3rem, 5.5vw, 4.9rem);
      line-height: 1.05;
      letter-spacing: -0.045em;
    }

    .affiliate-lead {
      max-width: 670px;
      margin: 26px 0 0;
      font-size: 1.08rem;
      line-height: 1.9;
    }

    .affiliate-summary-card {
      padding: 28px;
      border: 1px solid #dbe7ea;
      border-radius: 24px;
      background: linear-gradient(155deg, #ffffff 0%, #f7fbfc 100%);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 48px rgba(16, 36, 63, 0.08);
    }

    .summary-item {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 42px 1fr;
      gap: 14px;
      padding: 20px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid #e4ecee;
    }

    .summary-item:first-of-type {
      border-top: 0;
    }

    .summary-item > span {
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: var(--affiliate-lime);
      color: var(--affiliate-navy);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .summary-item strong {
      color: var(--affiliate-navy);
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .summary-item p {
      margin: 6px 0 0;
      color: var(--affiliate-muted);
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .affiliate-section {
      padding: 70px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--affiliate-line);
    }

    .affiliate-section h2,
    .affiliate-footer-links h2 {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--affiliate-navy);
      font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 3vw, 2.7rem);
      line-height: 1.2;
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    }

    .section-heading {
      max-width: 760px;
    }

    .section-heading > p:last-child {
      margin: 16px 0 0;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .affiliate-fact-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
      margin-top: 34px;
    }

    .affiliate-fact-grid article {
      min-height: 190px;
      padding: 24px;
      border: 1px solid #e0e8ea;
      border-radius: 18px;
      background: #fff;
    }

    .affiliate-fact-grid article > span {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      color: var(--affiliate-blue);
      font-size: 0.76rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }

    .affiliate-fact-grid strong {
      color: var(--affiliate-navy);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .affiliate-fact-grid p {
      margin: 10px 0 0;
      color: var(--affiliate-muted);
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .current-links-section {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);
      gap: 52px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .current-links-copy p {
      margin: 0;
      line-height: 1.85;
    }

    .current-links-copy p + p {
      margin-top: 18px;
    }

    .merchant-section {
      padding-top: 58px;
      padding-bottom: 58px;
    }

    .merchant-card {
      padding: 34px 36px;
      border: 1px solid #dfe8ea;
      border-radius: 24px;
      background: var(--affiliate-surface);
    }

    .merchant-card p:last-child {
      max-width: 880px;
      margin: 18px 0 0;
      line-height: 1.85;
    }

    .affiliate-footer-links {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 32px;
      align-items: center;
      margin-top: 68px;
      padding: 32px 34px;
      border-radius: 24px;
      background: #f2f8f9;
      border: 1px solid #dce9ec;
    }

    .affiliate-footer-links h2 {
      font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.4vw, 2rem);
    }

    .affiliate-link-group {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .affiliate-link-group a {
      color: var(--affiliate-blue);
      font-weight: 800;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .affiliate-hero,
      .current-links-section {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .affiliate-hero {
        gap: 30px;
        min-height: auto;
      }

      .affiliate-fact-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .affiliate-footer-links {
        align-items: flex-start;
        flex-direction: column;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .affiliate-page {
        width: min(100% - 28px, 1180px);
        padding-top: 28px;
      }

      .affiliate-hero {
        padding: 26px 0 48px;
      }

      .affiliate-hero h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 12vw, 3.5rem);
      }

      .affiliate-section {
        padding: 54px 0;
      }

      .affiliate-summary-card,
      .merchant-card {
        padding: 22px;
      }

      .affiliate-footer-links {
        margin-top: 54px;
        padding: 26px 22px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
